    keywords: ['how long to bake chicken thighs and vegetables', 'sheet pan chicken thighs time', 'chicken thigh internal temp', 'one pan chicken and vegetables', 'roast bone in chicken thighs sheet pan'],
    metaDescription: 'How long to roast bone-in chicken thighs with root vegetables: 400°F (204°C) for 32–38 minutes. Why to pull thighs at 175°F, not 165°F.',
