    foodSlug: 'classic-beef-stew-slow-cooker',
    appliance: 'slow-cooker',
    cutOrPrep: '2½ lb boneless chuck cut into 1½-inch cubes, patted bone-dry and seared hard in a skillet in three batches; layered over 1½ lb quartered Yukon Golds and 1 lb thick-cut carrots with 1 cup dry red wine + 2 cups beef stock, 2 tbsp tomato paste, 2 bay leaves',
    state: 'fresh',
