    donenessCue: 'A probe pushed into the thickest part of the flat slides in with no resistance — the classic "warm butter" feel; the onions underneath have collapsed into a jammy brown compote that sits in about 2 cups of dark liquid; the fat cap has rendered to a soft translucent ribbon.',
    oilSprayRequired: false,
