    donenessCue: 'The sauce is a rich mahogany rather than bright tomato red; individual grains of meat have collapsed into the tomato base with no visible clumps; fat has separated into a thin sheen on top (a good sign, not a bad one — skim it or stir it back in).',
    oilSprayRequired: false,
