    keywords: ['how long to brown ground beef in a skillet', 'ground beef browning time', 'ground beef internal temp', 'stovetop ground beef cook time', 'skillet taco meat browning'],
    metaDescription: 'How long to brown ground beef in a skillet: 7–10 min at medium-high. Sit-and-sear the first 3 min for Maillard fond, then break apart to 160°F.',
