    cutOrPrep: '4 medium-large globe artichokes, tops trimmed 1 inch flat, stems cut flush, thorny leaf tips snipped off with kitchen shears, dropped stem-down into 8 quarts of boiling water with 2 tbsp kosher salt, 1 halved lemon, and 3 bay leaves',
    state: 'fresh',
    tempF: 212,
