    keywords: ['ny strip steak cast iron time', 'how long to cook strip steak', 'thick strip steak internal temp', 'medium rare strip steak', 'strip steak vs ribeye carryover'],
    metaDescription: 'How long to cook a 1.5-inch NY strip in cast iron: 4 minutes per side to 130°F pull. Why strip steak pulls 1°F higher than ribeye.',
