    technicalDeepDive: 'Thigh meat\'s higher intramuscular fat and connective tissue means it tolerates sitting at 175°F, above the poultry safety floor, without the muscle fibers seizing and squeezing out moisture the way a leaner breast would at the same temperature. Many of the spices in a Kashmiri-style masala, including the curcumin in turmeric, are fat-soluble rather than water-soluble, so they dissolve gradually into the sauce\'s fat phase over the multi-hour cook instead of releasing all at once. That slow migration is only possible because the pot holds heat well below a boil, giving oil-soluble pigments time to move into the sauce without it ever breaking, and it\'s why the color and flavor keep deepening the longer the chunks sit submerged.',
    keywords: ["how long to slow cook chicken tikka masala", "chicken tikka masala slow cooker time", "chicken tikka masala slow cooker temperature", "slow cooker chicken tikka masala", "chicken tikka masala internal temp"],
    metaDescription: 'Slow cook chicken tikka masala on Low for 5 to 6 hours for succulent chicken chunks in creamy, rich, aromatic spiced tomato curry sauce.',
